{"id":"ae8ff2952a475545","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-kappa-complete.md","title":"$\\kappa$-Complete Ideal","display":"df-kappa-complete — $\\kappa$-Complete Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-kappa-complete","aliases":["58-df-kappa-complete","58-df-zfc-ideal6-kappa-complete-ideal"],"display":"df-kappa-complete — $\\kappa$-Complete Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-df-ideal]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-kappa-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-kappa-complete</span><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-kappa-complete-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kappa-complete — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-Complete Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(X,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\)</span> (ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}_\\kappa(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}_\\kappa(X)\\)</span> (collection notation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6KappaCompleteIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6KappaCompleteIdeal}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathcal I\\in\\mathrm{Ideal}_\\kappa(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6KappaCompleteIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathcal I\\in\\mathrm{Ideal}_\\kappa(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6KappaCompleteIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6KappaCompleteIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa&gt;0\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\;\\bigl(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal I\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6KappaCompleteIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa&gt;0\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\;\\bigl(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal I\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete ideal is closed under unions of fewer than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> many sets</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-ideal6-kappa-complete-ideal</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>The nonstationary ideal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{NS}\">\\(I_{NS}\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete for uncountable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness is used in saturation and precipitousness definitions</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))$ (ideal predicate, see [[58-df-ideal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"t